"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3649490/extras/f7422afbd2c2c2a041e56ee0e1d3fcd1.poster.avif?t=1750751832\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3649490/extras/f7422afbd2c2c2a041e56ee0e1d3fcd1.webm?t=1750751832\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3649490/extras/f7422afbd2c2c2a041e56ee0e1d3fcd1.mp4?t=1750751832\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deftly dodge the relentless barrage of their bottled-up emotions, and discover the source of their strange stories. By touching their heart with your words, you might just be able to save their souls.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3649490/extras/da53a5b8d8fdf9debc06f54331374160.poster.avif?t=1750751832\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3649490/extras/da53a5b8d8fdf9debc06f54331374160.webm?t=1750751832\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3649490/extras/da53a5b8d8fdf9debc06f54331374160.mp4?t=1750751832\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What other mysteries await you in this weird new world? Find out in <i>Stray Children</i> \u2014 an unfamiliar place, with all-too-familiar troubles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3649490/extras/978e0b1f7ce2f3b1ffdd96a7bd3a47ed.avif?t=1750751832\" data-has-big width=800 height=88 /></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We hope you\u2019ll have fun discovering all the secrets of <i>Stray Children</i>, but we have one final request for anyone and everyone who finishes the game: <strong><i>please keep the ending a secret</i></strong>!\u00a0</p>",
